v 3
d 'SPINEINV': Surgical Invasiveness Index from CPT codes
d
d Calculates the Surgical Invasiveness Index (the number of vertebrae
d decompressed, fused and instrumented, anteriorly and posteriorly)
d from CPT/HCPCS codes, with flags for add-on codes without a primary
d code, non-additive duplicates and co-coded tiered codes.
d
d Requires Stata 16 or later.
d
d Author: Brook I. Martin, PhD, MPH
d Department of Orthopaedics, University of Utah
d Support: Brook.Martin@hsc.utah.edu
d
d Version 5.1
d Distribution-Date: 20261105
d
f spineinv.ado
f spineinv.sthlp
F spineinv_codes.csv
f spineinv_test.do
